WEBVTT

00:00:02.272 --> 00:00:06.141
Grand aunt Elroy, arriving from Chicago,
invited Stear, Archie and the others...

00:00:06.176 --> 00:00:08.047
...in order to introduce Annie to them.

00:00:08.998 --> 00:00:13.180
Annie transferred to St. Paul academy.

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:22.028
On the other end, Annie's foster father,
Mr. Brighton, secretly met up with Candy,

00:00:22.063 --> 00:00:25.668
...and asked her to look after Annie.

00:00:28.536 --> 00:00:34.475
Revived smiles.

00:00:52.197 --> 00:00:55.527
Everyone, allow a new friend
to introduce herself to you.

00:00:57.037 --> 00:01:00.887
I'm Annie Brighton. I'm from America.
How do you do.

00:01:03.364 --> 00:01:07.194
We already have two Americans in this class.

00:01:07.195 --> 00:01:10.762
Eliza Leagan! Candice White Adley!
Please stand up.

00:01:11.174 --> 00:01:12.328
-Yes!
-Yes!

00:01:14.152 --> 00:01:15.271
Candy...

00:01:16.442 --> 00:01:18.265
To meet her so soon...!

00:01:18.877 --> 00:01:21.457
I want both of you to take good care of Annie.

00:01:21.795 --> 00:01:22.911
-Yes, sister!
-Yes, sister!

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:29.129
There is an empty desk next to Candy.
Annie, you can sit there.

00:01:29.425 --> 00:01:35.628
Uh, sister... I'm an acquaintance of Eliza...
...so please...

00:01:36.286 --> 00:01:39.632
Annie...
Annie is avoiding me!

00:01:39.825 --> 00:01:42.117
She isn't glad to see me!

00:01:42.701 --> 00:01:45.037
Sitting next to Eliza is...

00:01:45.214 --> 00:01:49.070
Uh, sister... I'll sit next to Candy.

00:01:49.105 --> 00:01:50.633
Alright, let's do that.

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:52.830
Well then, Annie, be seated.

00:02:08.575 --> 00:02:10.355
What's the matter, Candy?

00:02:11.808 --> 00:02:15.538
It's nothing.
Patty, thank you for sitting next to me.

00:02:15.754 --> 00:02:18.605
Be quiet.
We'll begin today's lecture.

00:02:19.845 --> 00:02:23.680
Candy, I'm sorry.
I can't sit right next to you...

00:02:24.113 --> 00:02:26.124
I could have accidentally said something to you.

00:02:33.243 --> 00:02:36.950
Say, that Candy - she was brought up in
some Pony-thing or something like that,

00:02:36.985 --> 00:02:39.145
...and after that, she became a daughter of Adleys.

00:02:40.106 --> 00:02:43.591
Louise, it's not "Pony-something", it's "Pony's home!"

00:02:45.981 --> 00:02:48.374
It's up in the mountains,
but it's such a beautiful place!

00:02:48.533 --> 00:02:49.881
Remember this well!

00:02:51.303 --> 00:02:55.234
I can't say it! I can't say that
I came from Pony's home, as well.

00:02:57.420 --> 00:03:00.334
Really! The girl from Pony's home is so rude!

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:03.357
-Oh, Annie, what's the matter?
-You don't look too well.

00:03:04.232 --> 00:03:05.388
It's nothing!

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:14.335
Annie, you're probably thinking that I'd blurt out
that we were both brought up in Pony's home.

00:03:14.921 --> 00:03:17.277
Don't tell me that you've come to hate me!

00:03:18.862 --> 00:03:23.543
I still treasure the ribbon
you left me in the barn.

00:03:24.655 --> 00:03:25.672
Annie.

00:03:28.458 --> 00:03:29.389
Stear!

00:03:29.931 --> 00:03:32.089
Hello, Candy.
I've been looking for you.

00:03:33.097 --> 00:03:35.688
Stear, you'll get in trouble if they find you here.

00:03:35.868 --> 00:03:38.707
It's okay. Sister gave me permission.

00:03:39.169 --> 00:03:40.804
-A permission?
-Yeah.

00:03:40.956 --> 00:03:44.815
Yes, in order to introduce the Adley family members
to the Brighton's Annie.

00:03:45.021 --> 00:03:49.135
-So I thought you'd like to accompany us.
-Stear, you!

00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:52.156
Now, let's go to the main hall.
Archie and the others are waiting for us.

00:03:52.191 --> 00:03:53.388
Archie and the others?

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:58.215
Yeah, Annie already caught that Archie guy.
Annie seems to be a lot into Archie.

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:09.325
Hello, Candy!
I waited for you!

00:04:13.849 --> 00:04:19.328
-Annie, you remember our former dogsbody, Candy?
-Yes, we're in the same class.

00:04:19.363 --> 00:04:22.191
Nice to meet you!
Call me Candy!

00:04:25.914 --> 00:04:27.932
I... I'm Annie.

00:04:28.688 --> 00:04:31.717
Annie... you're just scared, aren't you?

00:04:31.888 --> 00:04:33.815
You haven't changed inside, haven't you?

00:04:34.025 --> 00:04:39.963
That's right, Candy, Aunt Elroy got this scarf for you.

00:04:39.987 --> 00:04:42.526
Wow, for me?

00:04:42.741 --> 00:04:45.912
You're a member of the Adley family, after all.

00:04:46.347 --> 00:04:49.234
We haven't stopped complaining
until she let you have this.

00:04:49.445 --> 00:04:51.512
Thank you, Archie.

00:04:51.787 --> 00:04:53.669
Let's see how it suits you.

00:04:54.689 --> 00:04:56.555
Not bad, Candy!

00:04:57.407 --> 00:04:58.174
Lemme see.

00:04:59.551 --> 00:05:03.312
-What's up with that?
-Archie and Candy are getting along well, aren't they?

00:05:03.347 --> 00:05:08.744
That's right. Archie likes to watch over Candy.
Talk about inappropriate.

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:13.095
You haven't seen anything yet!
Those two are always sticking together!

00:05:15.408 --> 00:05:18.597
-We're going back to our rooms.
-See you!

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:25.126
Those two haven't changed at all. They must
spoil the mood whenever somebody is having fun.

00:05:25.322 --> 00:05:28.784
Uh...
I'll return to my room as well.

00:05:28.971 --> 00:05:30.738
I don't feel too well.

00:05:32.303 --> 00:05:36.245
Maybe she's tired from her long journey.
Archie, why don't you escort her to her room?

00:05:37.162 --> 00:05:38.834
-Go, go!
-Archie!

00:05:39.191 --> 00:05:40.938
Annie, I'll escort you to your room!

00:05:41.697 --> 00:05:44.326
-Are you okay?
-Yes...

00:05:45.617 --> 00:05:48.992
Archie likes Candy...
It can't be! But...

00:05:51.326 --> 00:05:52.573
Archie?

00:05:53.327 --> 00:05:56.067
Please... could we walk more slowly?

00:05:56.261 --> 00:05:57.394
Oh, sorry!

00:05:57.878 --> 00:06:01.243
You sure you don't want to see a doctor?
Maybe some medicine could help you?

00:06:01.688 --> 00:06:02.895
It's okay.

00:06:03.001 --> 00:06:05.370
Well then, hold on to my arm.
You can trust me.

00:06:07.798 --> 00:06:09.371
Archie... I like you.

00:06:10.132 --> 00:06:12.823
It's not true that you like Candy, right?

00:06:15.507 --> 00:06:18.145
I realize you're not feeling well,
but walking together like this...

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:20.943
This place has very strict rules, you know?

00:06:20.968 --> 00:06:25.652
Yes. But my mama wanted me to be educated here
in order to become a good wife and mother.

00:06:26.026 --> 00:06:29.821
Annie, you seriously think you wouldn't be able
to become all that without coming here?

00:06:30.927 --> 00:06:31.997
Archie...

00:06:32.398 --> 00:06:35.345
-Annie, I have a favor to ask of you.
-What is it?

00:06:35.539 --> 00:06:39.135
I'd like you to become Candy's friend.
Candy is such a good girl.

00:06:39.482 --> 00:06:42.517
She was brought up in Pony's home,
which wasn't a bad place at all.

00:06:42.971 --> 00:06:47.034
Candy is cheerful, carefree, but it's just that
whenever Eliza discovers something like this,

00:06:47.201 --> 00:06:48.664
...she turns it into a weapon of revenge.

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:53.499
I'd be very happy if the two of you could get along.
Please.

00:06:56.374 --> 00:06:57.845
Annie, what's the matter?

00:06:58.952 --> 00:07:02.441
I'm tired. Sorry, Archie!

00:07:05.593 --> 00:07:06.332
Annie?

00:07:09.445 --> 00:07:13.273
Archie... you like her that much?

00:07:13.557 --> 00:07:16.426
You don't understand my feelings, at all.

00:07:21.112 --> 00:07:23.250
Annie, I'd like you to become her friend!

00:07:23.458 --> 00:07:25.977
She was brought up in Pony's home,
but she's such a good girl!

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:33.854
Candy... you're exactly like in the past.
Cheerful, cocky, friendly towards anyone...

00:07:42.277 --> 00:07:44.792
-Candy, good morning!
-Good morning, Patty.

00:07:46.916 --> 00:07:48.074
Annie...

00:07:54.179 --> 00:07:59.652
She's so quiet... what is she knitting?
I've never seen her do anything like that.

00:08:00.553 --> 00:08:01.926
What are you knitting?

00:08:03.331 --> 00:08:06.919
I know. It's for Archie, right?
Tablecloth?

00:08:07.524 --> 00:08:10.504
Uh... Archie's birthday is drawing near...

00:08:10.911 --> 00:08:13.591
Archie is... Archibald Cornwell?

00:08:14.778 --> 00:08:17.823
That's right. Candy's friend.

00:08:19.092 --> 00:08:22.209
Just what is she saying? That Eliza...!

00:08:32.296 --> 00:08:33.260
Candy!

00:08:36.327 --> 00:08:37.423
Annie!

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:43.344
Annie, I wanted to speak to you!

00:08:43.472 --> 00:08:46.725
Candy, please... Don't take Archie!

00:08:48.154 --> 00:08:50.275
Please... Please, Candy!

00:08:50.345 --> 00:08:55.114
Annie, you don't have to worry!
We are just friends!

00:08:55.577 --> 00:08:58.742
Archie likes gentle girls, just like you.

00:08:59.153 --> 00:09:00.200
Candy.

00:09:00.636 --> 00:09:01.909
Annie, you!

00:09:01.931 --> 00:09:05.698
You're still a crybaby.
Now, smile!

00:09:06.136 --> 00:09:07.546
Candy...

00:09:15.126 --> 00:09:17.083
Terrius G. Grandchester!

00:09:21.534 --> 00:09:24.510
Don't scare me!
I thought it was sister Gray.

00:09:25.221 --> 00:09:26.935
Say, wanna smoke?

00:09:26.970 --> 00:09:29.284
You're doing it again?
Cut it out!

00:09:29.493 --> 00:09:31.879
You can't smoke at my Pony's hill!

00:09:35.379 --> 00:09:37.200
Instead, I'll let you have this.

00:09:37.765 --> 00:09:38.972
Harmonica?

00:09:39.635 --> 00:09:41.167
It's my favorite instrument.

00:09:42.274 --> 00:09:43.999
Hmmh, your favorite instrument?

00:09:44.937 --> 00:09:48.062
I see, you want me to kiss you indirectly.

00:09:48.267 --> 00:09:49.659
Terrius!

00:09:50.277 --> 00:09:51.686
Silly, I was just kidding.

00:09:51.721 --> 00:09:53.944
It pains me to do this, but
I'll have to accept your gift.

00:09:54.333 --> 00:09:57.440
Some things you do and say are so harsh...

00:10:13.195 --> 00:10:14.556
The class is beginning!

00:10:15.644 --> 00:10:20.018
Listen up. I'm going to class.
Play the harmonica instead of smoking!

00:10:20.314 --> 00:10:21.285
See you!

00:10:24.846 --> 00:10:26.886
What a nosy freckled Tarzan!

00:10:29.603 --> 00:10:30.466
Candy!

00:10:35.266 --> 00:10:36.359
Archie!

00:10:37.011 --> 00:10:39.818
*Denjin Anime Fansub*

00:10:44.149 --> 00:10:46.494
What's the matter?
Why are you looking at me like that?

00:10:46.529 --> 00:10:48.991
You are hooking up with that guy!

00:10:50.497 --> 00:10:51.848
With that nobleman!

00:10:52.218 --> 00:10:53.281
He's got an eye on you!

00:10:53.316 --> 00:10:57.046
Hook up... uh... I don't really...

00:10:57.081 --> 00:10:58.876
Candy... you'd better leave him alone!

00:10:59.204 --> 00:11:04.218
Why? It's just that nobody unsderstands him.
Actually, he's not such a bad person!

00:11:04.382 --> 00:11:05.594
He's deceiving you!

00:11:06.074 --> 00:11:08.249
Why are you protecting him, Candy?

00:11:08.432 --> 00:11:10.592
Protecting... but...

00:11:10.901 --> 00:11:14.050
What's gotten into you, Archie?
You're not your usual self.

00:11:14.652 --> 00:11:17.839
I... I don't want that guy to take you!

00:11:18.468 --> 00:11:20.488
Archie!

00:11:21.038 --> 00:11:27.859
For that bastard to take you...
From the first time I saw you, Candy, I...

00:11:27.894 --> 00:11:29.385
Stop it!

00:11:33.625 --> 00:11:34.445
Please, stop it!

00:11:35.644 --> 00:11:37.563
Annie... why are you here?

00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:41.305
I wanted to give this present to Archie...

00:11:41.954 --> 00:11:43.596
But now...

00:11:47.443 --> 00:11:48.705
Annie!

00:12:01.912 --> 00:12:03.445
"Happy birthday."

00:12:03.797 --> 00:12:05.347
"I made this with all my love."

00:12:05.472 --> 00:12:06.647
"Annie."

00:12:16.706 --> 00:12:18.224
Candice White Adley!

00:12:19.288 --> 00:12:20.501
Annie Brighton!

00:12:22.644 --> 00:12:25.743
Louise, Eliza; go and look for them.

00:12:32.057 --> 00:12:34.809
Annie, please, don't cry.

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:37.562
You promised! You promised!

00:12:38.184 --> 00:12:39.906
...that you wouldn't take Archie!

00:12:39.941 --> 00:12:41.521
Annie, calm down.

00:12:41.556 --> 00:12:45.369
I know everything! Archie likes you! Not me...

00:12:46.665 --> 00:12:47.874
Annie...

00:12:52.346 --> 00:12:54.432
Eliza and Louise. This isn't good.

00:12:54.467 --> 00:12:56.725
Class must have started and they
went out to find us.

00:12:58.396 --> 00:13:01.162
Annie, anyway, we'd better head
back to the classroom.

00:13:01.246 --> 00:13:02.542
We'll talk later... okay?

00:13:03.337 --> 00:13:04.371
Don't touch me!

00:13:04.426 --> 00:13:06.434
Candy, you were always like this!

00:13:06.754 --> 00:13:10.500
Even back in Pony's home,
the teachers liked you more than me!

00:13:10.799 --> 00:13:12.306
Annie, don't say that!

00:13:20.192 --> 00:13:24.020
Oh, I see. You were in Pony's home.

00:13:24.666 --> 00:13:27.263
The same place Candy came from.

00:13:32.420 --> 00:13:35.232
What a surprise!
Does Archie know?

00:13:35.355 --> 00:13:37.294
Your disguise was pretty good.

00:13:40.952 --> 00:13:42.362
Annie!

00:13:42.512 --> 00:13:43.776
Leave her alone!

00:13:43.972 --> 00:13:47.641
By the way, Candy, you knew about Annie
but you kept quiet till now?

00:13:47.892 --> 00:13:52.763
Covering each other... what a wonderful friendship!
People from Pony's home are all alike.

00:13:56.164 --> 00:13:58.791
Annie... poor Annie!

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:02.345
Candy, I'm scared...
won't you sleep together with me?

00:14:03.007 --> 00:14:05.898
Candy, Tom wants to beat me up!

00:14:06.302 --> 00:14:09.019
Candy! Candy!

00:14:09.367 --> 00:14:13.000
Annie, I'll protect you, no matter what.

00:14:22.727 --> 00:14:23.659
Rain.

00:14:25.469 --> 00:14:27.570
If Annie disappears now...

00:14:28.071 --> 00:14:29.278
Annie!

00:14:30.351 --> 00:14:33.484
Director, Annie Brighton hasn't been found yet?

00:14:33.519 --> 00:14:37.675
Anyway, we'll split up and search for her.

00:14:38.366 --> 00:14:40.316
Annie!

00:14:45.169 --> 00:14:48.189
Annie... just where did you go in this rain?

00:14:49.194 --> 00:14:50.433
Don't touch me!

00:14:50.718 --> 00:14:52.593
Candy, you were always like this!

00:14:52.688 --> 00:14:56.890
Even back in Pony's home,
the teachers liked you more than me!

00:14:56.955 --> 00:15:00.592
Annie, that's not true!

00:15:01.133 --> 00:15:06.629
Sister Pony and sister Lane
worried so much about you!

00:15:08.854 --> 00:15:13.858
-Candy, don't make Annie cry!
-Candy, look after Annie!

00:15:15.353 --> 00:15:17.384
Annie... just where are you now?

00:15:18.281 --> 00:15:20.554
Annie!

00:15:30.126 --> 00:15:33.381
It seems though we're the only ones looking
for her, and the forest is so big.

00:15:33.685 --> 00:15:34.512
Yeah.

00:15:36.074 --> 00:15:39.212
I don't see too well with my glasses being wet.

00:15:39.651 --> 00:15:40.848
Brother, sorry.

00:15:41.970 --> 00:15:44.453
You ruined your suit for my sake.

00:15:45.328 --> 00:15:49.383
Come on! It's you who's gonna
flop over first before finding Annie!

00:15:49.418 --> 00:15:53.570
Even if I flop over, will it change anything?
Just how blind I was?

00:15:54.357 --> 00:15:57.959
I didn't lie to Candy back then.
I thought about her from the very first moment.

00:15:58.122 --> 00:16:01.633
But, hiding the fact that she was in Pony's home...
...that she was in Pony's home...

00:16:01.807 --> 00:16:02.925
The fact she desperately tried to hide...

00:16:03.108 --> 00:16:06.742
The one who thought about me...
The one who thought about me was - Annie.

00:16:07.782 --> 00:16:09.937
"I made this with all my love."

00:16:09.938 --> 00:16:11.408
"With all my love."

00:16:14.970 --> 00:16:16.652
Oh, Candy.

00:16:18.431 --> 00:16:22.463
Archie, I've been looking for you.
I found Annie.

00:16:22.498 --> 00:16:24.911
But... I couldn't do it.

00:16:25.121 --> 00:16:32.312
Annie doesn't want to listen to me anymore...
Archie, she needs you.

00:16:33.874 --> 00:16:35.369
Where is she?

00:16:35.536 --> 00:16:38.658
In a cave near the other Pony's hill.

00:16:38.693 --> 00:16:43.143
Archie, please, you can help her.
Nobody else!

00:16:43.178 --> 00:16:47.711
Candy, you don't need to worry.
I'll bring her back for sure.

00:16:49.213 --> 00:16:50.791
Wait, I'll go...

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:56.629
Candy, Archie is on his way now, no need to worry.
Let's go back to the classroom.

00:16:57.891 --> 00:16:59.018
Yes.

00:17:04.313 --> 00:17:07.924
I wish I could disappear into the ground
together with this rain.

00:17:08.322 --> 00:17:12.546
Just why did my papa and mama
insist on sending me to England?

00:17:13.232 --> 00:17:17.627
Just why did they put me through all the pain
of having to hide my past in Pony's home?

00:17:18.037 --> 00:17:19.372
Was it because of Archie?

00:17:20.183 --> 00:17:21.571
But it's all over now.

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:22.911
Annie!

00:17:25.793 --> 00:17:28.243
Annie, it's me.
Come out!

00:17:28.502 --> 00:17:29.806
Everyone is worried about you!

00:17:30.446 --> 00:17:31.457
Archie!

00:17:33.678 --> 00:17:35.577
You found yourself an incredible place!

00:17:36.356 --> 00:17:38.398
You don't have to hide inside anymore.

00:17:38.613 --> 00:17:39.645
Leave me!

00:17:39.813 --> 00:17:41.291
I've deceived you!

00:17:41.809 --> 00:17:43.015
Deceived you!

00:17:43.845 --> 00:17:46.107
I'll stay right here until you get out.

00:17:46.665 --> 00:17:47.898
Say, Annie...

00:17:48.279 --> 00:17:51.393
Does it matter where you were brought up?
After all, you are you.

00:17:51.621 --> 00:17:52.705
Be strong!

00:17:53.819 --> 00:17:56.792
Don't be afraid of people who superficially
judge others by their exterior!

00:17:57.492 --> 00:17:58.289
Archie!

00:17:58.759 --> 00:18:03.090
Now that you know about me,
can you accept me like this?

00:18:03.206 --> 00:18:05.569
Yeah. I'll be here forever.

00:18:06.084 --> 00:18:07.802
For me...

00:18:09.099 --> 00:18:10.642
Of course!

00:18:20.128 --> 00:18:21.639
Archie!

00:18:27.888 --> 00:18:28.877
Archie.

00:18:35.175 --> 00:18:40.190
Say, did you hear?
Annie was in Pony's home, just like Candy!

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:42.150
She hid that well!

00:18:43.159 --> 00:18:47.121
As expected, Eliza's doing.
Everybody in school already knows.

00:18:50.115 --> 00:18:52.460
Oh, Candy, good morning.

00:18:52.461 --> 00:18:55.263
Your friend has a fever.

00:18:55.298 --> 00:18:59.615
Yeah, though you were both in Pony's home,
Annie is more delicate than you.

00:19:00.133 --> 00:19:03.759
Annie is a daughter of a good mr. Brighton!

00:19:04.174 --> 00:19:07.634
Doesn't matter who adopted her,
an orphan is always an orphan!

00:19:08.817 --> 00:19:09.702
Eliza!

00:19:09.737 --> 00:19:10.375
Candy!

00:19:12.313 --> 00:19:15.005
What a fright!
She goes crazy in a second!

00:19:15.117 --> 00:19:17.900
People from Pony's home are so vulgar!

00:19:19.225 --> 00:19:24.695
Candy, not all students are like them.
There is Annie... and I am here, as well!

00:19:25.031 --> 00:19:26.247
Patty!

00:19:27.396 --> 00:19:30.636
That's right, Annie!
I'm here as well.

00:19:34.213 --> 00:19:38.249
Candice, please watch over Annie.
She is waiting for you.

00:19:38.284 --> 00:19:39.347
Waiting?

00:19:39.589 --> 00:19:40.878
Annie is waiting for me!

00:19:42.422 --> 00:19:43.772
Annie is...

00:19:49.402 --> 00:19:50.353
Archie!

00:19:51.928 --> 00:19:53.055
Candy.

00:19:53.367 --> 00:19:54.737
She is asleep now.

00:19:54.772 --> 00:19:57.120
But before she fell asleep, she said
that she wanted you to stay next to her.

00:19:57.335 --> 00:20:00.961
If she has you next to her, Annie can feel at ease.

00:20:01.823 --> 00:20:03.259
-Right, Archie?
-Uh...

00:20:05.704 --> 00:20:07.652
Take good care of Annie, okay?

00:20:08.050 --> 00:20:09.024
I understand.

00:20:09.929 --> 00:20:10.834
See you!

00:20:18.944 --> 00:20:22.111
Annie looks so peaceful.
She's sound asleep.

00:20:26.905 --> 00:20:27.893
Annie!

00:20:29.453 --> 00:20:33.067
Candy.
I wanted to see you, so much!

00:20:34.257 --> 00:20:36.369
Annie, don't get up.

00:20:36.404 --> 00:20:38.330
Sorry for all that happened until now.

00:20:38.533 --> 00:20:43.219
Deep inside, I missed you so much
during this time.

00:20:43.888 --> 00:20:48.884
And for hiding my past in Pony's home...
I was stupid.

00:20:49.359 --> 00:20:51.088
It's okay, Annie.

00:20:51.272 --> 00:20:53.420
Candy, thank you.

00:20:53.642 --> 00:20:55.143
Again, I'm sorry.

00:20:56.932 --> 00:21:00.225
I'll cheer up! Just like you always do!

00:21:00.260 --> 00:21:01.680
I'll be true to myself!

00:21:02.007 --> 00:21:05.253
Just like you always were.
You haven't changed at all.

00:21:05.441 --> 00:21:07.010
My dearest Annie!

00:21:07.924 --> 00:21:14.844
Candy remembered the old days, when she used
to run with Annie to the top of Pony's hill.

00:21:16.197 --> 00:21:20.178
To be continued.
